  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Heyo!!\n\nSo i'ved always has the idea of sharing homes with friends.\n\nLike when I join my home and if my friend is online and just chilling in the home I'll join their home server as well\n\nThat way it would be less difficult if having to invite your friend over and it to be hard\n\nThe home can take up to the amount of people the original server does\n\n(I.e: if I make a world that the limit is 15 people, 15 friends can be in the same home)\n\nThere could also be another tab for the home, that you can select who to kick out of the home and who to add(by looking for their username) and to see who has invited you to their home\n\nAnd if you had invited a player that had already joined a home it would say \"The player that you had invited to your home is already currently in a home\"\n\nIs a nice idea that I came up with, probably other people had already came up with it, and if they did, they have very creative thoughts\n\nAnyways have a great time!",
